520
00:28:28.055 --> 00:28:29.613
<i>Hey.</i>

521
00:28:29.724 --> 00:28:33.421
<i>- Hey. I got props.
- Props? For what?</i>

522
00:28:33.527 --> 00:28:35.586
Props. Objects for you to throw knives at.

523
00:28:35.696 --> 00:28:38.460
No. no. You are going to stand
against the board- still.

524
00:28:38.566 --> 00:28:41.535
I am gonna throw knives
around you. but not too close.

525
00:28:41.636 --> 00:28:43.604
That does not sound like a very good act.

526
00:28:43.704 --> 00:28:45.934
