- Buck and Wanda were damn good.

727
00:42:39.596 --> 00:42:42.997
Buck was more dashing than you. I mean.
Buck drove a motorcycle.

728
00:42:43.100 --> 00:42:45.591
- Well. Wanda was funner than you.
- How?

729
00:42:45.702 --> 00:42:48.535
She let me knock off
a rubber nose from her face with a knife.

730
00:42:48.638 --> 00:42:52.165
<i>You would never let me do that.
You are way too rational.</i>

731
00:42:52.275 --> 00:42:55.244
<i># Have no envy #</i>

732
00:42:55.345 --> 00:42:57.176
<i># And no fear#</i>

733
00:42:57.280 --> 00:42:59.441
Where do you think they are now?

734
00:43:01.518 --> 00:43:03.486
Over the horizon.

